<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - SPORT ARENA | Hệ Thống Đặt Sân Bóng Đá</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-sport: #0d6efd;
            --secondary-sport: #198754;
            --dark-sport: #111827;
        }
        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #334155;
        }
        .hero-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #065f46 50%, #047857 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 3.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.3);
        }
        .navbar-brand-custom {
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }
        .badge-status {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
            border-radius: 0.375rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .card-custom {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
        }
        .card-custom:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08) !important;
        }
        .footer-custom {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
        .footer-custom h5 {
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-light d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark py-3 shadow-sm sticky-top">
            <div class="container-fluid px-lg-5">
                <a class="navbar-brand navbar-brand-custom text-success d-flex align-items-center" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                    <i class="bi bi-dribbble text-warning me-2 fs-3"></i>
                    <span>SPORT ARENA</span>
                </a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarMain"
                        aria-controls="navbarMain" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarMain">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0 fw-medium">
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link px-3" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                                <i class="bi bi-house-door me-1"></i> Trang Chủ
                            </a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link px-3 text-warning" asp-area="" asp-controller="Field" asp-action="Index">
                                <i class="bi bi-calendar2-check me-1"></i> Đặt Sân Thi Đấu
                            </a>
                        </li>
                        @if (User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true)
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link px-3" asp-area="" asp-controller="Booking" asp-action="MyBookings">
                                    <i class="bi bi-receipt me-1"></i> Đơn Đặt Của Tôi
                                </a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link px-3" asp-area="" asp-controller="Booking" asp-action="Notifications">
                                    <i class="bi bi-bell me-1"></i> Thông Báo
                                </a>
                            </li>
                        }
                        @if (User.IsInRole("Staff") || User.IsInRole("Manager") || User.IsInRole("Admin"))
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link px-3 text-info fw-semibold" asp-area="" asp-controller="Staff" asp-action="Index">
                                    <i class="bi bi-person-workspace me-1"></i> Quầy Lễ Tân
                                </a>
                            </li>
                        }
                        @if (User.IsInRole("Manager") || User.IsInRole("Admin"))
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link px-3 text-light fw-semibold" asp-area="Admin" asp-controller="Dashboard" asp-action="Index">
                                    <i class="bi bi-sliders me-1"></i> Quản Trị Hệ Thống
                                </a>
                            </li>
                        }
                    </ul>

                    <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0 align-items-center">
                        @if (User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true)
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item dropdown">
                                <a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle text-white d-flex align-items-center gap-2" href="#" id="userDropdown" role="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
                                    <i class="bi bi-person-circle fs-5 text-warning"></i>
                                    <span>@User.Identity.Name</span>
                                    <span class="badge bg-secondary">@User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Role)?.Value</span>
                                </a>
                                <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end shadow-sm border-0" aria-labelledby="userDropdown">
                                    <li><a class="dropdown-item py-2" asp-area="" asp-controller="Booking" asp-action="MyBookings"><i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-2"></i> Lịch Đặt Của Tôi</a></li>
                                    <li><a class="dropdown-item py-2" asp-area="" asp-controller="Booking" asp-action="Notifications"><i class="bi bi-bell me-2"></i> Thông Báo Cá Nhân</a></li>
                                    <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>
                                    <li>
                                        <form asp-area="" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" method="post" class="d-inline">
                                            <button type="submit" class="dropdown-item py-2 text-danger">
                                                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-2"></i> Đăng Xuất
                                            </button>
                                        </form>
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <li class="nav-item me-2">
                                <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-3" asp-area="" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">
                                    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-1"></i> Đăng Nhập
                                </a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="btn btn-success btn-sm px-3 fw-semibold" asp-area="" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register">
                                    <i class="bi bi-person-plus me-1"></i> Đăng Ký
                                </a>
                            </li>
                        }
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container my-4 flex-grow-1">
        @if (TempData["SuccessMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show shadow-sm border-0 d-flex align-items-center" role="alert">
                <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill me-2 fs-5"></i>
                <div>@TempData["SuccessMessage"]</div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
        }
        @if (TempData["ErrorMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show shadow-sm border-0 d-flex align-items-center" role="alert">
                <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2 fs-5"></i>
                <div>@TempData["ErrorMessage"]</div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
        }

        <main role="main" class="pb-4">
            @RenderBody()
        </main>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer-custom pt-5 pb-4 mt-auto">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3 d-flex align-items-center text-success">
                        <i class="bi bi-dribbble text-warning me-2"></i> SPORT ARENA
                    </h5>
                    <p class="small text-muted">
                        Tổ hợp sân bóng đá cỏ nhân tạo cao cấp đạt chuẩn quốc tế. Cung cấp trải nghiệm thi đấu thể thao đỉnh cao, hệ thống đặt sân trực tuyến minh bạch, tiện lợi 24/7.
                    </p>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3 fs-5 text-secondary">
                        <a href="#" class="text-secondary"><i class="bi bi-facebook"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-secondary"><i class="bi bi-youtube"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-secondary"><i class="bi bi-tiktok"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">Liên Hệ & Hỗ Trợ</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted">
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt text-warning me-2"></i> Khu liên hợp thể thao Sport Arena, Hà Nội</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-telephone text-warning me-2"></i> Hotline đặt sân: <strong>0987.654.321</strong> (6:00 - 23:00)</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-envelope text-warning me-2"></i> Email: lienhe@sportarena.vn</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-clock text-warning me-2"></i> Mở cửa: 06:00 - 23:00 tất cả các ngày trong tuần</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-12">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">Cam Kết Dịch Vụ</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted">
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i> Giữ chỗ độc quyền 15 phút không lo mất slot</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i> Hoàn 100% tiền cọc khi hủy do mưa bão, thời tiết xấu</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i> Thanh toán linh hoạt qua mã VietQR, thẻ ATM & ví điện tử</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr class="border-secondary my-4" />
            <div class="text-center small text-muted">
                &copy; 2026 SPORT ARENA - Nền tảng quản lý và vận hành sân bóng đá chuyên nghiệp.
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
